      371   DEFINE QUERY Dialog-Frame FOR
      372         tt-dis-rule,
      373         locked_dis-rule SCROLLING.
      374   DEFINE FRAME Dialog-Frame
      375        B-exit AT ROW 1 COL 1
      376        b-quit AT ROW 1 COL 11
      377        B-time-rule-lookup AT ROW 1 COL 41
      378        B-hist AT ROW 1 COL 92
      379        B-Help AT ROW 1 COL 95
